{"openapi":"3.1.0","info":{"title":"CorpStacking API","version":"1.0.0","description":"REST API for corporate, government, and ETF treasury holdings of Bitcoin, Ethereum, and Solana plus XRP (spot XRP funds and other holders we verify). Query holdings, SEC filings, prices, historical purchases, and a real-time signals feed. Every holdings figure ships with how it was verified and a link to its primary source. Authenticate with the x-api-key header (a key in the query string is not accepted). JSON responses are wrapped in { data, meta }; the raw downloads (CSV, JSON Lines) and the event stream are not. Errors are always { error: { code, message, request_id } } with the status listed on each operation. A failed data read is an error, never an empty result. Responses that depend on your key are Cache-Control: private; this document and /api/v1 are public and cacheable for an hour.","contact":{"name":"CorpStacking Support","url":"https://www.corpstacking.com/api-docs"},"license":{"name":"CorpStacking Terms of Service","url":"https://www.corpstacking.com/legal/terms"}},"servers":[{"url":"https://www.corpstacking.com/api/v1","description":"Production"}],"security":[{"apiKey":[]}],"tags":[{"name":"activity"},{"name":"export"},{"name":"market"},{"name":"signals"},{"name":"stats"},{"name":"tokens"},{"name":"treasuries"},{"name":"usage"},{"name":"webhooks"}],"paths":{"/stats":{"get":{"summary":"Aggregate treasury stats","description":"Total holdings, current USD value, cost basis, unrealized profit/loss, and entity count across the tracked universe (companies, ETFs, and governments combined). The token block carries the asset details: ticker, the unit it is displayed in, its maximum supply (for Bitcoin), and the live spot price used for the USD value. Cost basis and profit/loss describe only the positions whose cost is known: a holder that has not published what it paid is left out of both sides (its coins are in total_holdings and total_usd_value, not in total_cost_basis or unrealized_pnl), and cost_basis_coverage says how many positions (entity_count, out of holder_count companies) and how many coins the cost figures describe. total_cost_basis, avg_cost_basis_usd and unrealized_pnl are null when no position has a known cost; total_usd_value, unrealized_pnl and token.price_usd are null when no price is stored. For token=ripple the holders are spot XRP funds, and the token block also carries supply_basis, circulating_supply (null when unavailable) and supply_note: supply_cap is the supply created at launch, not what circulates, so measure a share against circulating_supply.","operationId":"get_stats","tags":["stats"],"parameters":[{"name":"token","in":"query","required":false,"description":"Token to roll up. Defaults to bitcoin. Non-bitcoin values require Pro+. An unknown value is a 400 invalid_filter that lists the valid tokens.","schema":{"type":"string","enum":["bitcoin","ethereum","solana","ripple"],"example":"bitcoin"}}],"x-required-plan":"pro","responses":{"200":{"description":"Aggregate treasury stats","headers":{"X-Request-Id":{"$ref":"#/components/headers/X-Request-Id"},"X-RateLimit-Limit":{"$ref":"#/components/headers/X-RateLimit-Limit"},"X-RateLimit-Remaining":{"$ref":"#/components/headers/X-RateLimit-Remaining"},"X-RateLimit-Reset":{"$ref":"#/components/headers/X-RateLimit-Reset"},"X-Quota-Limit":{"$ref":"#/components/headers/X-Quota-Limit"},"X-Quota-Remaining":{"$ref":"#/components/headers/X-Quota-Remaining"},"X-Quota-Reset":{"$ref":"#/components/headers/X-Quota-Reset"}},"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","required":["data","meta"],"properties":{"data":{"type":"object","properties":{"token":{"type":"object","properties":{"id":{"type":"string"},"symbol":{"type":"string"},"display_unit":{"type":"string"},"supply_cap":{"type":"integer"},"price_usd":{"type":"number"}},"required":["id","symbol","display_unit","supply_cap","price_usd"]},"entity_count":{"type":"integer"},"total_holdings":{"type":"integer"},"total_usd_value":{"type":"integer"},"total_cost_basis":{"type":"integer"},"unrealized_pnl":{"type":"integer"},"avg_cost_basis_usd":{"type":"number"},"cost_basis_coverage":{"type":"object","properties":{"entity_count":{"type":"integer"},"holder_count":{"type":"integer"},"total_holdings":{"type":"integer"}},"required":["entity_count","holder_count","total_holdings"]},"total_purchases":{"type":"integer"},"most_recent_purchase":{"type":"string"}},"required":["token","entity_count","total_holdings","total_usd_value","total_cost_basis","unrealized_pnl","avg_cost_basis_usd","cost_basis_coverage","total_purchases","most_recent_purchase"]},"meta":{"allOf":[{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Meta"},{"type":"object","properties":{"timestamp":{"type":"string"},"request_id":{"type":"string"},"token":{"type":"string"}},"required":["timestamp","request_id","token"]}]}}},"example":{"data":{"token":{"id":"bitcoin","symbol":"BTC","display_unit":"BTC","supply_cap":21000000,"price_usd":83512.44},"entity_count":248,"total_holdings":3830257,"total_usd_value":319874107897,"total_cost_basis":76000000000,"unrealized_pnl":24632490200,"avg_cost_basis_usd":63070.54,"cost_basis_coverage":{"entity_count":112,"holder_count":190,"total_holdings":1205000},"total_purchases":7086,"most_recent_purchase":"2026-04-13"},"meta":{"timestamp":"2026-04-19T14:00:00.000Z","request_id":"…","token":"bitcoin"}}}}},"400":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/BadRequest"},"401":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/Unauthorized"},"403":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/Forbidden"},"405":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/MethodNotAllowed"},"429":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/RateLimited"},"500":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/InternalError"}}}},"/treasuries":{"get":{"summary":"All tracked treasuries","description":"Full list of tracked entities (public companies, private companies, ETFs, and governments) with holdings, cost basis, treasury rank, and verification metadata. Sorted by holdings descending, ties broken by id so a page never repeats or skips a row; rank is the absolute leaderboard position and is the same whichever page the row is on. Each row carries how its figure was verified (source_tier + a click-through source_citation_url, data_confidence, and the coverage_class plus a plain-English reason) so you can sort or filter the leaderboard by trust without a second call. A creditor's claim on a position, when there is one, is in encumbrance (null when there is none). Bitcoin rows carry the amount as btc_holdings; every other token's rows carry token_id and holdings (see the second example). avg_price_usd and total_cost_usd are null for a holder that publishes no cost, or whose cost we will not publish, on every token (unknown is null, never 0; before 2026-10-06 Bitcoin, Ethereum and Solana rows sent 0 here, see the changelog). cost_basis_converted_from and cost_basis_note are null unless the company reports what it paid in its own currency only and the dollar cost is our conversion of it: then cost_basis_converted_from is the currency (ISO 4217, for example JPY) and cost_basis_note is the sentence to show next to the figure (each purchase converted at the Federal Reserve's published exchange rate for its date and added up; not a dollar figure the company states), so show the note wherever you show the cost. Use entity_type to pull a single segment (e.g. just ETFs or just governments). Counts in meta.total are a pagination hint and can be approximate on very large lists. With token=ripple the rows are spot XRP funds (no operating company is counted); a company that holds XRP below our usual size threshold can appear, marked below_threshold true with a plain-language below_threshold_label and a null rank, and so can the company that created XRP, marked unranked true with unranked_kind issuer_holdings and an unranked_label. Each fund carries balance_as_of, the date its balance is as of; last_purchase is null because a fund reports a balance, not purchases, and avg_price_usd and total_cost_usd are null (never 0) when the fund publishes no cost. meta.watched names companies that announced a plan but have not completed it: they are never rows of data and are in no total.","operationId":"get_treasuries","tags":["treasuries"],"parameters":[{"name":"token","in":"query","required":false,"description":"Filter to entities whose primary treasury asset is this token. Defaults to bitcoin. Non-bitcoin values require Pro+.","schema":{"type":"string","enum":["bitcoin","ethereum","solana","ripple"],"example":"bitcoin"}},{"name":"entity_type","in":"query","required":false,"description":"Limit to one segment. Omit (or pass all) to return every segment.","schema":{"type":"string","enum":["public_company","private_company","government","etf","all"],"example":"etf"}},{"name":"limit","in":"query","required":false,"description":"Max rows to return. Default 100, max 200 (a larger value is clamped; a value that is not a number falls back to the default).","schema":{"type":"integer","example":50}},{"name":"offset","in":"query","required":false,"description":"Row offset for pagination. Default 0.","schema":{"type":"integer","example":100}}],"x-required-plan":"pro","responses":{"200":{"description":"All tracked treasuries","headers":{"X-Request-Id":{"$ref":"#/components/headers/X-Request-Id"},"X-RateLimit-Limit":{"$ref":"#/components/headers/X-RateLimit-Limit"},"X-RateLimit-Remaining":{"$ref":"#/components/headers/X-RateLimit-Remaining"},"X-RateLimit-Reset":{"$ref":"#/components/headers/X-RateLimit-Reset"},"X-Quota-Limit":{"$ref":"#/components/headers/X-Quota-Limit"},"X-Quota-Remaining":{"$ref":"#/components/headers/X-Quota-Remaining"},"X-Quota-Reset":{"$ref":"#/components/headers/X-Quota-Reset"}},"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","required":["data","meta"],"properties":{"data":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"object","properties":{"id":{"type":"string"},"ticker":{"type":"string"},"name":{"type":"string"},"slug":{"type":"string"},"country":{"type":"string"},"flag_emoji":{"type":"string"},"logo_domain":{"type":"string"},"logo_initial":{"type":"string"},"entity_type":{"type":"string"},"sec_cik":{"type":"string"},"website":{"type":"string"},"rank":{"type":"integer"},"btc_holdings":{"type":"integer"},"avg_price_usd":{"type":"integer"},"total_cost_usd":{"type":"integer"},"cost_basis_converted_from":{"description":"null in the example: the value is absent or not published."},"cost_basis_note":{"description":"null in the example: the value is absent or not published."},"last_purchase":{"type":"string"},"source_tier":{"type":"string"},"source_citation_url":{"type":"string"},"encumbrance":{"type":["object","null"],"properties":{"amount":{"type":"integer"},"kind":{"type":"string"},"as_of":{"type":"string"},"note":{"type":"string"},"source_url":{"type":"string"},"description":{"type":"string"}}},"data_confidence":{"type":"string"},"coverage_class":{"type":"string"},"coverage_class_reason":{"type":"string"},"is_active":{"type":"boolean"},"primary_token_id":{"type":"string"},"token_id":{"type":"string"},"holdings":{"type":"integer"}},"required":["id","ticker","name","slug","country","flag_emoji","logo_domain","logo_initial","entity_type","sec_cik","website","rank","avg_price_usd","total_cost_usd","cost_basis_converted_from","cost_basis_note","last_purchase","source_tier","source_citation_url","encumbrance","data_confidence","coverage_class","coverage_class_reason","is_active","primary_token_id"]}},"meta":{"allOf":[{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Meta"},{"type":"object","properties":{"timestamp":{"type":"string"},"request_id":{"type":"string"},"total":{"type":"integer"},"limit":{"type":"integer"},"offset":{"type":"integer"},"token":{"type":"string"},"entity_type":{"type":"string"}},"required":["timestamp","request_id","total","limit","offset","token","entity_type"]}]}}},"example":{"data":[{"id":"uuid","ticker":"MSTR","name":"Strategy","slug":"microstrategy","country":"US","flag_emoji":"🇺🇸","logo_domain":"strategy.com","logo_initial":"S","entity_type":"public_company","sec_cik":"0001050446","website":"https://strategy.com","rank":1,"btc_holdings":818869,"avg_price_usd":75577,"total_cost_usd":59013000000,"cost_basis_converted_from":null,"cost_basis_note":null,"last_purchase":"2026-04-13","source_tier":"primary","source_citation_url":"https://www.sec.gov/cgi-bin/browse-edgar?...","encumbrance":{"amount":12000,"kind":"pledged","as_of":"2026-03-31","note":"Pledged as collateral for a credit facility.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/...","description":"12,000 BTC of the 818,869 BTC held is pledged as collateral (as of 2026-03-31)."},"data_confidence":"high","coverage_class":"verified_events_sec","coverage_class_reason":"Every position change is backed by an SEC filing.","is_active":true,"primary_token_id":"bitcoin"},{"id":"uuid","ticker":"BMNR","name":"BitMine Immersion","slug":"bitmine-immersion","country":"US","flag_emoji":"🇺🇸","logo_domain":"bitminetech.io","logo_initial":"B","entity_type":"public_company","sec_cik":"0001829311","website":"https://bitminetech.io","rank":1,"is_active":true,"primary_token_id":"ethereum","token_id":"ethereum","holdings":3500000,"avg_price_usd":3120,"total_cost_usd":10920000000,"cost_basis_converted_from":null,"cost_basis_note":null,"last_purchase":"2026-04-11","source_tier":"primary","source_citation_url":"https://www.sec.gov/cgi-bin/browse-edgar?...","encumbrance":null,"data_confidence":"high","coverage_class":"verified_events_sec","coverage_class_reason":"Every position change is backed by an SEC filing."}],"meta":{"timestamp":"2026-04-19T14:00:00.000Z","request_id":"…","total":248,"limit":100,"offset":0,"token":"bitcoin","entity_type":"all"}}}}},"400":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/BadRequest"},"401":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/Unauthorized"},"403":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/Forbidden"},"405":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/MethodNotAllowed"},"429":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/RateLimited"},"500":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/InternalError"}}}},"/treasuries/{slug}":{"get":{"summary":"Single treasury detail + activity history","description":"Everything we hold on one entity: holdings + cost basis (token-native amount, amount_usd, avg cost, total cost), analyst metrics (mNAV, sats/share, % of market cap, debt-to-coin, enterprise value — see /market for the spot price they use; debt-to-coin and enterprise value are null while debtKnown / cashKnown is false, meaning the figure is still being verified against official filings, not that the company has no debt; debtAsOf / cashAsOf give the balance-sheet date each figure comes from — older than a quarter when the company has filed nothing newer; balanceScope is parent_only when debt and cash describe the parent company rather than the consolidated group, in which case debt-to-coin and enterprise value are null by design), full verification metadata (source_tier + source_citation_url, the data_confidence block with its computed tier / matching sources / any operator override, and coverage_class with a plain-English reason), and up to the last 100 discrete treasury events. The company fields (market_cap, shares_outstanding, debt_usd, cash_usd and the dates they come from, and so on) are the entity record as we hold it; updated_at is when we last changed that record (it moves for any field, so it is not the freshness of the holdings figure: use last_purchase, balance_as_of and data_confidence.updated_at for that). For a Bitcoin position avg_price_usd and total_cost_usd are the position's; for every other asset the legacy btc_holdings is 0 and the amount is in amount and holdings (token_id and purchases[].token_id name the asset). avg_price_usd and total_cost_usd are null when the cost is not published or we will not publish it; amount_usd is null when no price is stored. cost_basis_converted_from and cost_basis_note are null unless the company reports what it paid in its own currency only and the dollar cost is our conversion of it: then cost_basis_converted_from is the currency (ISO 4217, for example JPY) and cost_basis_note is the sentence to show next to the figure (each purchase converted at the Federal Reserve's published exchange rate for its date and added up; not a dollar figure the company states), so show the note wherever you show the cost. Each event carries its primary-source citation (filing_url + sec_accession), the SEC filing date, and an AI one-line summary. Replace {slug} in the path with the slug from /treasuries (a value that cannot be a slug is a 404). Pass ?token= (Pro+) to read a non-primary asset for the same entity. For an XRP fund, purchases is empty (a fund reports a balance as of balance_as_of, not purchases) and avg_price_usd and total_cost_usd are null when the fund publishes no cost. A company below our usual size threshold, and the company that created XRP, carry below_threshold, below_threshold_label, unranked, unranked_kind and unranked_label, as described under /treasuries.","operationId":"get_treasuries_slug","tags":["treasuries"],"parameters":[{"name":"slug","in":"path","required":true,"description":"Treasury slug (e.g. microstrategy).","schema":{"type":"string","example":"microstrategy"}},{"name":"token","in":"query","required":false,"description":"Read a specific asset for this entity instead of its primary. Non-bitcoin values require Pro+.","schema":{"type":"string","enum":["bitcoin","ethereum","solana","ripple"],"example":"bitcoin"}}],"x-required-plan":"pro","responses":{"200":{"description":"Single treasury detail + activity history","headers":{"X-Request-Id":{"$ref":"#/components/headers/X-Request-Id"},"X-RateLimit-Limit":{"$ref":"#/components/headers/X-RateLimit-Limit"},"X-RateLimit-Remaining":{"$ref":"#/components/headers/X-RateLimit-Remaining"},"X-RateLimit-Reset":{"$ref":"#/components/headers/X-RateLimit-Reset"},"X-Quota-Limit":{"$ref":"#/components/headers/X-Quota-Limit"},"X-Quota-Remaining":{"$ref":"#/components/headers/X-Quota-Remaining"},"X-Quota-Reset":{"$ref":"#/components/headers/X-Quota-Reset"}},"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","required":["data","meta"],"properties":{"data":{"type":"object","properties":{"id":{"type":"string"},"name":{"type":"string"},"ticker":{"type":"string"},"slug":{"type":"string"},"country":{"type":"string"},"flag_emoji":{"type":"string"},"logo_domain":{"type":"string"},"logo_initial":{"type":"string"},"sec_cik":{"type":"string"},"website":{"type":"string"},"btc_holdings":{"type":"integer"},"avg_price_usd":{"type":"integer"},"total_cost_usd":{"type":"integer"},"cost_basis_converted_from":{"description":"null in the example: the value is absent or not published."},"cost_basis_note":{"description":"null in the example: the value is absent or not published."},"last_purchase":{"type":"string"},"is_active":{"type":"boolean"},"entity_type":{"type":"string"},"primary_token_id":{"type":"string"},"market_cap":{"type":"integer"},"market_cap_refreshed_at":{"type":"string"},"shares_outstanding":{"type":"integer"},"shares_refreshed_at":{"type":"string"},"debt_usd":{"type":"integer"},"cash_usd":{"type":"integer"},"debt_as_of":{"type":"string"},"cash_as_of":{"type":"string"},"balance_scope":{"type":"string"},"coverage_class":{"type":"string"},"coverage_class_reason":{"type":"string"},"coverage_class_updated_at":{"type":"string"},"updated_at":{"type":"string"},"token_id":{"type":"string"},"token":{"type":"object","properties":{"id":{"type":"string"},"symbol":{"type":"string"},"name":{"type":"string"}},"required":["id","symbol","name"]},"holdings":{"type":"integer"},"amount":{"type":"integer"},"amount_usd":{"type":"integer"},"source_tier":{"type":"string"},"source_citation_url":{"type":"string"},"metrics":{"type":"object","properties":{"mnav":{"type":"number"},"satsPerShare":{"description":"null in the example: the value is absent or not published."},"btcPctOfMcap":{"type":"number"},"debtToBtcRatio":{"type":"integer"},"enterpriseValueUsd":{"type":"integer"},"btcValueUsd":{"type":"integer"},"debtKnown":{"type":"boolean"},"cashKnown":{"type":"boolean"},"debtAsOf":{"type":"string"},"cashAsOf":{"type":"string"},"balanceScope":{"type":"string"}},"required":["mnav","satsPerShare","btcPctOfMcap","debtToBtcRatio","enterpriseValueUsd","btcValueUsd","debtKnown","cashKnown","debtAsOf","cashAsOf","balanceScope"]},"data_quality":{"type":"object","properties":{"tier":{"type":"string"},"verified_rows":{"type":"integer"},"total_rows":{"type":"integer"}},"required":["tier","verified_rows","total_rows"]},"data_confidence":{"type":"object","properties":{"tier":{"type":"string"},"computed_tier":{"type":"string"},"sources":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"string"}},"updated_at":{"type":"string"},"operator_override":{"type":"object","properties":{"tier":{"type":"string"},"reason":{"type":"string"},"at":{"type":"string"}},"required":["tier","reason","at"]}},"required":["tier","computed_tier","sources","updated_at","operator_override"]},"purchases":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"object","properties":{"id":{"type":"string"},"token":{"type":"string"},"token_id":{"type":"string"},"amount":{"type":"integer"},"btc_amount":{"type":"integer"},"usd_amount":{"type":"integer"},"price_per_unit":{"type":"integer"},"price_per_btc":{"type":"integer"},"purchase_date":{"type":"string"},"filing_date":{"type":"string"},"total_holdings_after":{"type":"integer"},"source":{"type":"string"},"filing_url":{"type":"string"},"sec_accession":{"type":"string"},"summary":{"type":"string"}},"required":["id","token","amount","btc_amount","price_per_unit","price_per_btc","purchase_date"]}}},"required":["id","name","ticker","slug","btc_holdings","avg_price_usd","total_cost_usd","cost_basis_converted_from","cost_basis_note","token","amount","amount_usd","purchases"]},"meta":{"allOf":[{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Meta"},{"type":"object","properties":{"timestamp":{"type":"string"},"request_id":{"type":"string"},"token":{"type":"string"}},"required":["timestamp","request_id","token"]}]}}},"example":{"data":{"id":"uuid","name":"BitMine Immersion","ticker":"BMNR","slug":"bitmine-immersion","country":"US","flag_emoji":"🇺🇸","logo_domain":"bitminetech.io","logo_initial":"B","sec_cik":"0001829311","website":"https://bitminetech.io","btc_holdings":0,"avg_price_usd":3120,"total_cost_usd":10920000000,"cost_basis_converted_from":null,"cost_basis_note":null,"last_purchase":"2026-04-11","is_active":true,"entity_type":"public_company","primary_token_id":"ethereum","market_cap":14200000000,"market_cap_refreshed_at":"2026-04-19T06:00:00Z","shares_outstanding":420000000,"shares_refreshed_at":"2026-04-19T06:00:00Z","debt_usd":0,"cash_usd":480000000,"debt_as_of":"2026-03-31","cash_as_of":"2026-03-31","balance_scope":"consolidated","coverage_class":"verified_events_sec","coverage_class_reason":"Every position change is backed by an SEC filing.","coverage_class_updated_at":"2026-04-01T00:00:00Z","updated_at":"2026-04-19T06:00:00Z","token_id":"ethereum","token":{"id":"ethereum","symbol":"ETH","name":"Ethereum"},"holdings":3500000,"amount":3500000,"amount_usd":8680000000,"source_tier":"primary","source_citation_url":"https://www.sec.gov/cgi-bin/browse-edgar?...","metrics":{"mnav":1.42,"satsPerShare":null,"btcPctOfMcap":61.1,"debtToBtcRatio":0,"enterpriseValueUsd":13720000000,"btcValueUsd":8680000000,"debtKnown":true,"cashKnown":true,"debtAsOf":"2026-03-31","cashAsOf":"2026-03-31","balanceScope":"consolidated"},"data_quality":{"tier":"verified","verified_rows":98,"total_rows":100},"data_confidence":{"tier":"high","computed_tier":"high","sources":["bitbo","coingecko","bitcointreasuries"],"updated_at":"2026-04-19T06:00:00Z","operator_override":{"tier":"high","reason":"Checked against the filing.","at":"2026-04-10T00:00:00Z"}},"purchases":[{"id":"uuid","token":"ethereum","token_id":"ethereum","amount":120000,"btc_amount":120000,"usd_amount":372000000,"price_per_unit":3100,"price_per_btc":3100,"purchase_date":"2026-04-11","filing_date":"2026-04-13","total_holdings_after":3500000,"source":"sec_edgar","filing_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/...","sec_accession":"0001829311-26-000045","summary":"BitMine disclosed a purchase of 120,000 ETH for about $372M."}]},"meta":{"timestamp":"2026-04-19T14:00:00.000Z","request_id":"…","token":"ethereum"}},"examples":{"default":{"value":{"data":{"id":"uuid","name":"BitMine Immersion","ticker":"BMNR","slug":"bitmine-immersion","country":"US","flag_emoji":"🇺🇸","logo_domain":"bitminetech.io","logo_initial":"B","sec_cik":"0001829311","website":"https://bitminetech.io","btc_holdings":0,"avg_price_usd":3120,"total_cost_usd":10920000000,"cost_basis_converted_from":null,"cost_basis_note":null,"last_purchase":"2026-04-11","is_active":true,"entity_type":"public_company","primary_token_id":"ethereum","market_cap":14200000000,"market_cap_refreshed_at":"2026-04-19T06:00:00Z","shares_outstanding":420000000,"shares_refreshed_at":"2026-04-19T06:00:00Z","debt_usd":0,"cash_usd":480000000,"debt_as_of":"2026-03-31","cash_as_of":"2026-03-31","balance_scope":"consolidated","coverage_class":"verified_events_sec","coverage_class_reason":"Every position change is backed by an SEC filing.","coverage_class_updated_at":"2026-04-01T00:00:00Z","updated_at":"2026-04-19T06:00:00Z","token_id":"ethereum","token":{"id":"ethereum","symbol":"ETH","name":"Ethereum"},"holdings":3500000,"amount":3500000,"amount_usd":8680000000,"source_tier":"primary","source_citation_url":"https://www.sec.gov/cgi-bin/browse-edgar?...","metrics":{"mnav":1.42,"satsPerShare":null,"btcPctOfMcap":61.1,"debtToBtcRatio":0,"enterpriseValueUsd":13720000000,"btcValueUsd":8680000000,"debtKnown":true,"cashKnown":true,"debtAsOf":"2026-03-31","cashAsOf":"2026-03-31","balanceScope":"consolidated"},"data_quality":{"tier":"verified","verified_rows":98,"total_rows":100},"data_confidence":{"tier":"high","computed_tier":"high","sources":["bitbo","coingecko","bitcointreasuries"],"updated_at":"2026-04-19T06:00:00Z","operator_override":{"tier":"high","reason":"Checked against the filing.","at":"2026-04-10T00:00:00Z"}},"purchases":[{"id":"uuid","token":"ethereum","token_id":"ethereum","amount":120000,"btc_amount":120000,"usd_amount":372000000,"price_per_unit":3100,"price_per_btc":3100,"purchase_date":"2026-04-11","filing_date":"2026-04-13","total_holdings_after":3500000,"source":"sec_edgar","filing_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/...","sec_accession":"0001829311-26-000045","summary":"BitMine disclosed a purchase of 120,000 ETH for about $372M."}]},"meta":{"timestamp":"2026-04-19T14:00:00.000Z","request_id":"…","token":"ethereum"}}},"variant_1":{"value":{"data":{"id":"uuid","name":"Strategy","ticker":"MSTR","slug":"microstrategy","btc_holdings":818869,"avg_price_usd":75577,"total_cost_usd":59013000000,"cost_basis_converted_from":null,"cost_basis_note":null,"token":{"id":"bitcoin","symbol":"BTC","name":"Bitcoin"},"amount":818869,"amount_usd":68390000000,"purchases":[{"id":"uuid","token":"bitcoin","amount":13927,"btc_amount":13927,"price_per_unit":71870,"price_per_btc":71870,"purchase_date":"2026-04-13"}]},"meta":{"timestamp":"2026-04-19T14:00:00.000Z","request_id":"…","token":"bitcoin"}}}}}}},"400":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/BadRequest"},"401":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/Unauthorized"},"403":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/Forbidden"},"404":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/NotFound"},"405":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/MethodNotAllowed"},"429":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/RateLimited"},"500":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/InternalError"}}}},"/activity":{"get":{"summary":"Paginated treasury activity feed","description":"Global feed of recent treasury events across every tracked entity. Includes both buys (positive amount) and sells (negative amount, e.g. ETF daily outflows). Each row is a discrete, citable disclosure and ships with its primary source: filing_url + sec_accession (resolve at sec.gov), the SEC filing_date, and an AI one-line summary. Rows are ordered by event date and then by id, so paging by offset never repeats or skips a row. Note: governments report their holdings as official headline figures, not as individual dated transactions, so filtering this feed to a government returns an empty list (meta.note says why) — that is by design, not a gap. The current government position is on /treasuries/{slug}. est_usd_value is an estimate used only where the filing states no dollar amount, and is null otherwise. Counts in meta.total are a pagination hint and can be approximate on very large feeds. A malformed since, or a company that is not a slug, is a 400 / 404. token=ripple returns net changes, not purchases: XRP funds report balances, so each row is the net change between two balances one fund reported from the same source (event_type net_change, direction added or removed, a plain-language net_change_label, from_amount, to_amount, from_as_of, to_as_of, a source_label naming where the balances were reported, no dollar value). The list is empty until a fund has reported twice.","operationId":"get_activity","tags":["activity"],"parameters":[{"name":"token","in":"query","required":false,"description":"Filter to a specific token. Defaults to bitcoin. Non-bitcoin values require Pro+.","schema":{"type":"string","enum":["bitcoin","ethereum","solana","ripple"],"example":"bitcoin"}},{"name":"company","in":"query","required":false,"description":"Filter to a single entity by its treasury slug. An unknown or malformed slug is a 404 not_found.","schema":{"type":"string","example":"microstrategy"}},{"name":"entity_type","in":"query","required":false,"description":"Limit to one segment. Governments have no per-event activity (see note above).","schema":{"type":"string","enum":["public_company","private_company","government","etf","all"],"example":"etf"}},{"name":"since","in":"query","required":false,"description":"ISO date (YYYY-MM-DD, optionally with a time) — only include events on or after this date. Anything else is a 400 invalid_filter.","schema":{"type":"string","example":"2026-01-01"}},{"name":"order","in":"query","required":false,"description":"Sort direction by event date. Default desc (newest first).","schema":{"type":"string","enum":["asc","desc"],"example":"asc"}},{"name":"exclude_period_deltas","in":"query","required":false,"description":"Pass true to drop balance-change rows (a disclosed total moving between two dates, such as a month of staking or mining) and keep only transactions.","schema":{"type":"boolean","example":true}},{"name":"limit","in":"query","required":false,"description":"Page size. Default 50, max 100 (a larger value is clamped; a value that is not a number falls back to the default).","schema":{"type":"integer","example":100}},{"name":"offset","in":"query","required":false,"description":"Row offset for pagination. Default 0.","schema":{"type":"integer","example":50}}],"x-required-plan":"pro","responses":{"200":{"description":"Paginated treasury activity feed","headers":{"X-Request-Id":{"$ref":"#/components/headers/X-Request-Id"},"X-RateLimit-Limit":{"$ref":"#/components/headers/X-RateLimit-Limit"},"X-RateLimit-Remaining":{"$ref":"#/components/headers/X-RateLimit-Remaining"},"X-RateLimit-Reset":{"$ref":"#/components/headers/X-RateLimit-Reset"},"X-Quota-Limit":{"$ref":"#/components/headers/X-Quota-Limit"},"X-Quota-Remaining":{"$ref":"#/components/headers/X-Quota-Remaining"},"X-Quota-Reset":{"$ref":"#/components/headers/X-Quota-Reset"}},"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","required":["data","meta"],"properties":{"data":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"object","properties":{"id":{"type":"string"},"token_id":{"type":"string"},"amount":{"type":"integer"},"btc_amount":{"type":"integer"},"usd_amount":{"type":"integer"},"est_usd_value":{"description":"null in the example: the value is absent or not published."},"price_per_btc":{"type":"integer"},"purchase_date":{"type":"string"},"filing_date":{"type":"string"},"total_holdings_after":{"type":"integer"},"source":{"type":"string"},"sec_accession":{"type":"string"},"filing_url":{"type":"string"},"summary":{"type":"string"},"company":{"type":"object","properties":{"ticker":{"type":"string"},"name":{"type":"string"},"slug":{"type":"string"},"country":{"type":"string"},"flag_emoji":{"type":"string"},"logo_domain":{"type":"string"},"logo_initial":{"type":"string"}},"required":["ticker","name","slug","country","flag_emoji","logo_domain","logo_initial"]}},"required":["id","token_id","amount","btc_amount","usd_amount","est_usd_value","price_per_btc","purchase_date","filing_date","total_holdings_after","source","sec_accession","filing_url","summary","company"]}},"meta":{"allOf":[{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Meta"},{"type":"object","properties":{"timestamp":{"type":"string"},"request_id":{"type":"string"},"total":{"type":"integer"},"limit":{"type":"integer"},"offset":{"type":"integer"},"token":{"type":"string"},"entity_type":{"type":"string"},"note":{"type":"string"}},"required":["timestamp","request_id","total","limit","offset","token","entity_type","note"]}]}}},"example":{"data":[{"id":"abc-123","token_id":"bitcoin","amount":13927,"btc_amount":13927,"usd_amount":1001000000,"est_usd_value":null,"price_per_btc":71870,"purchase_date":"2026-04-13","filing_date":"2026-04-14","total_holdings_after":818869,"source":"sec_edgar","sec_accession":"0000950170-26-000123","filing_url":"https://sec.gov/...","summary":"Strategy disclosed a purchase of 13,927 BTC for about $1.0B.","company":{"ticker":"MSTR","name":"Strategy","slug":"microstrategy","country":"US","flag_emoji":"🇺🇸","logo_domain":"strategy.com","logo_initial":"S"}}],"meta":{"timestamp":"2026-04-19T14:00:00.000Z","request_id":"…","total":3450,"limit":50,"offset":0,"token":"bitcoin","entity_type":"all","note":"Only present when there is something to explain, for example an empty feed for a government."}}}}},"400":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/BadRequest"},"401":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/Unauthorized"},"403":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/Forbidden"},"404":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/NotFound"},"405":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/MethodNotAllowed"},"429":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/RateLimited"},"500":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/InternalError"}}}},"/market":{"get":{"summary":"Live token prices + global stats","description":"Latest prices for the tracked tokens, plus global market cap, 24h volume, BTC/ETH dominance, and the Fear & Greed index (value plus its text label, e.g. \"Greed\", and fear_greed_basis: this is the market-wide Crypto Fear & Greed Index, which follows Bitcoin). XRP appears with its price and market data. There is no XRP-specific Fear & Greed reading: fear_greed_value is the market-wide index and is never XRP's own.","operationId":"get_market","tags":["market"],"x-required-plan":"pro","responses":{"200":{"description":"Live token prices + global stats","headers":{"X-Request-Id":{"$ref":"#/components/headers/X-Request-Id"},"X-RateLimit-Limit":{"$ref":"#/components/headers/X-RateLimit-Limit"},"X-RateLimit-Remaining":{"$ref":"#/components/headers/X-RateLimit-Remaining"},"X-RateLimit-Reset":{"$ref":"#/components/headers/X-RateLimit-Reset"},"X-Quota-Limit":{"$ref":"#/components/headers/X-Quota-Limit"},"X-Quota-Remaining":{"$ref":"#/components/headers/X-Quota-Remaining"},"X-Quota-Reset":{"$ref":"#/components/headers/X-Quota-Reset"}},"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","required":["data","meta"],"properties":{"data":{"type":"object","properties":{"tokens":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"object","properties":{"id":{"type":"string"},"symbol":{"type":"string"},"name":{"type":"string"},"price_usd":{"type":"number"},"price_change_24h":{"type":"number"},"price_change_7d":{"type":"number"},"price_change_30d":{"type":"number"},"market_cap":{"type":"integer"},"volume_24h":{"type":"integer"},"circulating_supply":{"type":"integer"},"ath":{"type":"integer"},"market_cap_rank":{"type":"integer"},"last_updated":{"type":"string"}},"required":["id","symbol","name","price_usd","price_change_24h","price_change_7d","price_change_30d","market_cap","volume_24h","circulating_supply","ath","market_cap_rank","last_updated"]}},"stats":{"type":"object","properties":{"total_market_cap":{"type":"integer"},"total_volume_24h":{"type":"integer"},"btc_dominance":{"type":"number"},"eth_dominance":{"type":"number"},"active_coins":{"type":"integer"},"fear_greed_value":{"type":"integer"},"fear_greed_label":{"type":"string"},"fear_greed_basis":{"type":"string"}},"required":["total_market_cap","total_volume_24h","btc_dominance","eth_dominance","active_coins","fear_greed_value","fear_greed_label","fear_greed_basis"]}},"required":["tokens","stats"]},"meta":{"allOf":[{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Meta"},{"type":"object","properties":{"timestamp":{"type":"string"},"request_id":{"type":"string"}},"required":["timestamp","request_id"]}]}}},"example":{"data":{"tokens":[{"id":"bitcoin","symbol":"BTC","name":"Bitcoin","price_usd":83512.44,"price_change_24h":-1.23,"price_change_7d":2.4,"price_change_30d":8.1,"market_cap":1650000000000,"volume_24h":42000000000,"circulating_supply":19850000,"ath":126000,"market_cap_rank":1,"last_updated":"2026-04-19T13:58:00Z"}],"stats":{"total_market_cap":3200000000000,"total_volume_24h":180000000000,"btc_dominance":58.2,"eth_dominance":11.4,"active_coins":12,"fear_greed_value":62,"fear_greed_label":"Greed","fear_greed_basis":"crypto_market_index"}},"meta":{"timestamp":"2026-04-19T14:00:00.000Z","request_id":"…"}}}}},"401":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/Unauthorized"},"403":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/Forbidden"},"405":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/MethodNotAllowed"},"429":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/RateLimited"},"500":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/InternalError"}}}},"/tokens":{"get":{"summary":"Supported tokens","description":"The tracked tokens, in a fixed order (Bitcoin, Ethereum, Solana, then any token added later), with their display unit and maximum supply. stats is the roll-up for the token (entity_count, total_amount, most_recent_purchase, and total_cost_usd / avg_cost_basis_usd over the positions whose cost is known, null when none is); it is null for a token your plan does not unlock (unlocked_for_key false). Pro+ unlocks non-bitcoin tokens. The XRP entry also carries supply_basis and supply_note (supply_cap is not the circulating supply).","operationId":"get_tokens","tags":["tokens"],"x-required-plan":"pro","responses":{"200":{"description":"Supported tokens","headers":{"X-Request-Id":{"$ref":"#/components/headers/X-Request-Id"},"X-RateLimit-Limit":{"$ref":"#/components/headers/X-RateLimit-Limit"},"X-RateLimit-Remaining":{"$ref":"#/components/headers/X-RateLimit-Remaining"},"X-RateLimit-Reset":{"$ref":"#/components/headers/X-RateLimit-Reset"},"X-Quota-Limit":{"$ref":"#/components/headers/X-Quota-Limit"},"X-Quota-Remaining":{"$ref":"#/components/headers/X-Quota-Remaining"},"X-Quota-Reset":{"$ref":"#/components/headers/X-Quota-Reset"}},"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","required":["data","meta"],"properties":{"data":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"object","properties":{"id":{"type":"string"},"symbol":{"type":"string"},"name":{"type":"string"},"display_unit":{"type":"string"},"display_unit_scale":{"type":"integer"},"supply_cap":{"type":["integer","null"]},"color":{"type":"string"},"coingecko_id":{"type":"string"},"requires_pro_plus":{"type":"boolean"},"unlocked_for_key":{"type":"boolean"},"stats":{"type":["object","null"],"properties":{"entity_count":{"type":"integer"},"total_amount":{"type":"integer"},"total_cost_usd":{"type":"integer"},"avg_cost_basis_usd":{"type":"number"},"most_recent_purchase":{"type":"string"}}}},"required":["id","symbol","name","display_unit","display_unit_scale","supply_cap","color","coingecko_id","requires_pro_plus","unlocked_for_key","stats"]}},"meta":{"allOf":[{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Meta"},{"type":"object","properties":{"timestamp":{"type":"string"},"request_id":{"type":"string"}},"required":["timestamp","request_id"]}]}}},"example":{"data":[{"id":"bitcoin","symbol":"BTC","name":"Bitcoin","display_unit":"BTC","display_unit_scale":1,"supply_cap":21000000,"color":"#F7931A","coingecko_id":"bitcoin","requires_pro_plus":false,"unlocked_for_key":true,"stats":{"entity_count":248,"total_amount":3830257,"total_cost_usd":76000000000,"avg_cost_basis_usd":63070.54,"most_recent_purchase":"2026-04-13"}},{"id":"ethereum","symbol":"ETH","name":"Ethereum","display_unit":"ETH","display_unit_scale":1,"supply_cap":null,"color":"#627EEA","coingecko_id":"ethereum","requires_pro_plus":true,"unlocked_for_key":false,"stats":null}],"meta":{"timestamp":"2026-04-19T14:00:00.000Z","request_id":"…"}}}}},"401":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/Unauthorized"},"403":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/Forbidden"},"405":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/MethodNotAllowed"},"429":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/RateLimited"},"500":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/InternalError"}}}},"/export":{"get":{"summary":"Bulk data export","description":"CSV or JSON bulk export of discrete treasury events (one row per disclosed buy/sell, with its per-(entity, token) data-confidence tier). Pro+ includes non-BTC tokens. Governments have no per-event rows here (their holdings are headline figures — use /treasuries). format=csv is a raw file download; format=json is the usual { data, meta } wrapper with the rows under data and meta.total, returned, limit, token, entity_type and truncated (true when more rows matched than limit allowed). Rows are ordered newest first, ties by id, so a large export is complete and never repeats a row. In the CSV, a text value that begins with = + - or @ is written with a leading apostrophe so a spreadsheet never runs it as a formula. since must be a real ISO date (400 invalid_filter otherwise); company must be a slug (404 not_found otherwise); a limit outside 1 to 50,000 is clamped, and one that is not a number falls back to the default. token=ripple exports no rows: XRP funds report balances, not purchases.","operationId":"get_export","tags":["export"],"parameters":[{"name":"format","in":"query","required":true,"description":"Export format.","schema":{"type":"string","enum":["csv","json"],"example":"csv"}},{"name":"token","in":"query","required":false,"description":"Filter to a specific token. Defaults to bitcoin. Non-bitcoin values require Pro+.","schema":{"type":"string","enum":["bitcoin","ethereum","solana","ripple"],"example":"bitcoin"}},{"name":"entity_type","in":"query","required":false,"description":"Limit to one segment.","schema":{"type":"string","enum":["public_company","private_company","government","etf","all"],"example":"etf"}},{"name":"company","in":"query","required":false,"description":"Filter to a single entity by its treasury slug. An unknown or malformed slug is a 404 not_found.","schema":{"type":"string","example":"microstrategy"}},{"name":"since","in":"query","required":false,"description":"ISO date (YYYY-MM-DD, optionally with a time) — only include events on or after this date. Anything else is a 400 invalid_filter.","schema":{"type":"string","example":"2026-01-01"}},{"name":"limit","in":"query","required":false,"description":"Max rows. Default 10,000, max 50,000 (a larger value is clamped; a value that is not a number falls back to the default).","schema":{"type":"integer","example":50000}}],"x-required-plan":"pro","responses":{"200":{"description":"Bulk data export","headers":{"X-Request-Id":{"$ref":"#/components/headers/X-Request-Id"},"X-RateLimit-Limit":{"$ref":"#/components/headers/X-RateLimit-Limit"},"X-RateLimit-Remaining":{"$ref":"#/components/headers/X-RateLimit-Remaining"},"X-RateLimit-Reset":{"$ref":"#/components/headers/X-RateLimit-Reset"},"X-Quota-Limit":{"$ref":"#/components/headers/X-Quota-Limit"},"X-Quota-Remaining":{"$ref":"#/components/headers/X-Quota-Remaining"},"X-Quota-Reset":{"$ref":"#/components/headers/X-Quota-Reset"}},"content":{"text/csv":{"schema":{"type":"string"},"example":"company,ticker,country,token_id,amount,usd_amount,price_per_unit,purchase_date,t